    3. Pick marker count k in [1..4].
    4. Choose k distinct rows from [1..nrows-2].
    5. For each chosen row, pick a column in [1..ncols-4] and a unique non-BLACK non-GREY color.
    6. Place each marker as a single pixel.
```
